





1. GenomeParameters — scalar tunable physics values

These are the numeric values that shape operator behavior.

GenomeParameters:
  warp_A: float
  warp_B: float
  warp_p: float
  warp_C: float
  warp_q: float

  chaos_strength: float
  chaos_frequency: float
  chaos_threshold: float

  nonlocal_scale: float
  nonlocal_decay: float

  curvature_damping: float
  curvature_growth: float

  mixer_temperature: float
  mixer_bias_strength: float

These are the “genes” that mutate most frequently.

2. GenomeOperators — operator‑level genetic switches

This determines which operators exist in a universe and how strongly they contribute.

GenomeOperators:
  enable_newtonian: bool
  enable_relativistic: bool
  enable_warp: bool
  enable_nonlocal: bool
  enable_chaotic: bool

  operator_weights:
    newtonian: float
    relativistic: float
    warp: float
    nonlocal: float
    chaotic: float

This allows evolution to add/remove operators or shift their dominance.

3. GenomeMixerBias — meta‑equation weight shaping

This controls how the meta‑equation blends operators.

GenomeMixerBias:
  warp_bias: float
  rel_bias: float
  chaos_bias: float
  nonlocal_bias: float
  newtonian_bias: float

  weight_curve_exponent: float
  weight_gradient_exponent: float
  weight_energy_exponent: float

These genes mutate more slowly — they shape the style of the universe.

4. GenomeRegimeRules — thresholds for switching physics

These genes define when the engine transitions between regimes.

GenomeRegimeRules:
  warp_activation_threshold: float
  chaos_activation_threshold: float
  nonlocal_activation_threshold: float

  curvature_soft_cap: float
  curvature_hard_cap: float

  gradient_trigger: float
  energy_trigger: float

This is where universes evolve adaptive behavior.

🧬 Full LawGenome Object (Combined Schema)

Here is the complete, unified structure:

LawGenome:
  parameters: GenomeParameters
  operators: GenomeOperators
  mixer_bias: GenomeMixerBias
  regime_rules: GenomeRegimeRules

  metadata:
    generation: int
    mutation_rate: float
    ancestry: list

This gives you:

scalar genes

structural genes

meta‑equation genes

regime genes

evolutionary metadata

This is a complete genetic encoding of a universe’s laws.



